# Level 5, reached by password XHRS, then the first shot anything has ever put
# into `$81:D7F6`.
#
# `enemy_d7f6_collide` has had six of its seven branches untaken since the day it
# was written, and the reason was never the corpus's thinness. `--records` found
# the routine on level 17 at (563,513) three rounds ago and the level-17 movies
# have walked past it ever since without landing a shot, because **the creature
# there is in a sealed pen**: `zamn_assets route ... --reach` tints the two
# alcoves at (456..520, 504..520) and (552..616, 504..520) orange -- open ground
# with no way into it -- and a squirt-gun shot fired from the strip above dies
# six pixels out, against the counter between.
#
# The handler is not level 17's, it is behaviour `$81:D704`'s, and six levels
# place one: 5, 17, 29, 31, 49 and 54. Of the four a password reaches, level 49's
# is cut off like level 17's and level 29's is 430 cells away. **Level 5's is 166
# cells from the spawn, standing in the open.**
#
#   for i in $(seq 1 56); do zamn_assets actors <rom> $i; done   # behavior $81:D704
#   zamn_assets route <rom> 6 190 113 985 120 --reach reach6.png
#
# The route is `tools/fit_route.py`, nine legs, arriving at (926,123) on frame
# 3208 -- the fitter's first run, with no hand-tuning at all, which is what an
# open level costs. Then Right and Y held, and the fight is over in fifty frames.
#
# What it buys, and the arithmetic behind the counts: `--watch 050C` reads the
# creature's health word as **`$0001`**, so the first hit leaves it at zero and
# the three after it go negative --
#
#   3235  $0001 -> $0000   d7f6_survived   (1 - 1 is not a borrow)
#   3246  $0000 -> $FFFF   d7f6_died
#   3258, 3270            d7f6_died again, twice
#
# -- one survivor and three deaths against `d7f6_hit` 20, `d7f6_died` 15 and
# `d7f6_survived` 5 in the report. Five interceptions per call; the ratio is the
# thing that is measured, and it is 1:3 in both.
#
